8
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:20,360
Two hundred ten D fabric takes a whole winter.

9
00:00:20,360 --> 00:00:23,200
Packs into the storage bag it comes with.

10
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:24,600
Roof only.

11
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:26,000
Never the whole thing.

12
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:28,600
Bag included.

13
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:31,520
Grab it while it's in stock.

14
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:33,440
Order the roof cover.

15
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:34,640
Roof only.

16
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:36,640
No buddy needed.
